ass=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\">では、</span><span class=\"s6\">5</span><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>のクイズです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\">（ｼﾞｬｰｼﾞｬﾝ</span><span class=\"s10\">🎶</span><span class=\"s7\">）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s10\">🐰</span><span class=\"s7\">おにぎりの<ruby>具<rt>ぐ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>中<rt>なか</rt></ruby>で<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が</span><span class=\"s6\">1</span><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きな<ruby>物<rt>もの</rt></ruby>はなんでしょう！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\">⑴<ruby>鮭<rt>さけ</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\">⑵<ruby>昆布<rt>こんぶ</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\">⑶<ruby>塩<rt>しお</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\">⑷<ruby>梅<rt>うめ</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\">⑸ツナマヨ</span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\">⑹<ruby>明太子<rt>めんたいこ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>簡単<rt>かんたん</rt></ruby>そうなので<ruby>選択肢<rt>せんたくし</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s6\">6</span><span class=\"s7\">つにしました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: a